 click delivery ambiguity markers","parents":["cd0317a399052d6f4bd36ea4274a0f8c318956f5"],"sha":"9b0fdafb6c91e356b8165448fc96426a60a8981d"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T18:06:42Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T18:06:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/cd2fa5eda9ba3d1194e4f33c0eb455d81023b317","message":"Preserve bounded browser text contract","parents":["9b0fdafb6c91e356b8165448fc96426a60a8981d"],"sha":"cd2fa5eda9ba3d1194e4f33c0eb455d81023b317"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T18:06:46Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T18:06:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/02291a8e2d3c89660c7b5a0100d2626f8f2f6967","message":"Run visual delivery ambiguity acceptance","parents":["cd2fa5eda9ba3d1194e4f33c0eb455d81023b317"],"sha":"02291a8e2d3c89660c7b5a0100d2626f8f2f6967"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T18:06:53Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T18:06:53Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/115c4b462a127bfb8c85f6b18c70dad16256a3bd","message":"Guard browser authorization bundle assets","parents":["02291a8e2d3c89660c7b5a0100d2626f8f2f6967"],"sha":"115c4b462a127bfb8c85f6b18c70dad16256a3bd"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T18:11:53Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T18:11:53Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/04f066f91f84cff07d0e3b9b2e322a780918af56","message":"Keep browser no-op receipt bounded","parents":["115c4b462a127bfb8c85f6b18c70dad16256a3bd"],"sha":"04f066f91f84cff07d0e3b9b2e322a780918af56"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T18:11:59Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T18:11:59Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/d818c0a1f738784b15639749c9a883e4d592ed13","message":"Expect hardened legacy alias no-op semantics","parents":["04f066f91f84cff07d0e3b9b2e322a780918af56"],"sha":"d818c0a1f738784b15639749c9a883e4d592ed13"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:11Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:11Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/a4da9c74438d5b40abcce515b601c3436a59c73e","message":"Canonicalize semantic browser resources as UTF-8","parents":["d818c0a1f738784b15639749c9a883e4d592ed13"],"sha":"a4da9c74438d5b40abcce515b601c3436a59c73e"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:14Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:14Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/e7636956ede08767b37b6ec6ce087a738b45dd87","message":"Cover Unicode browser authorization bounds","parents":["a4da9c74438d5b40abcce515b601c3436a59c73e"],"sha":"e7636956ede08767b37b6ec6ce087a738b45dd87"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:34Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:34Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/adbdd70bf51e47d3dc33b6b99bb52b7773d5fa53","message":"Exercise Unicode browser authorization through Node bridge","parents":["e7636956ede08767b37b6ec6ce087a738b45dd87"],"sha":"adbdd70bf51e47d3dc33b6b99bb52b7773d5fa53"},{"author_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:51Z","committer_date":"2026-09-22T20:25:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/c9fce847c0712ac913d6cb49787f892c11514fbb","message":"Guard browser authorization Unicode boundary","parents":["adbdd70bf51e47d3dc33b6b99bb52b7773d5fa53"],"sha":"c9fce847c0712ac913d6cb49787f892c11514fbb"}],"issue_comments":[],"issue_reactions":[],"pr_number":169,"pull_request":{"base":{"ref":"research/workspace-grant-binding","repo":"BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform","repo_id":1326588757,"repo_node_id":"R_kgDOTxIjVQ","sha":"4e940f5aa40d580183790b0a4e2ebe280b50787c"},"body":"## Purpose\n\nClose the remaining direct semantic mutation authority/verification gap after #168.\n\nBase: #168 (`research/workspace-grant-binding`).\n\nAffected accepted public tools:\n\n- `workspace_write`\n- `web_open`\n- `web_interact`\n\nThe public six-tool inventory remains unchanged.\n\n## Stage Research\n\n`project-context/DIRECT_SEMANTIC_MUTATION_GATE_RESEARCH.md`\n\nDecision: **NARROW**.\n\nSelected architecture:\n\n```text\nsemantic profile startup\n -> launcher-owned ephemeral activation identity\n -> fresh capability-native pre-state\n -> capability-specific attenuation to one exact Core grant\n -> existing CapabilityGrant / AuthorizationRequest decision\n -> one bounded physical delivery\n -> fresh project-owned verification/reconciliation\n```\n\nThe tool request is not the grant. MCP/OAuth reachability is not local CAP effect authorization.\n\n## Implementation slices\n\n### Slice 1\n\n- explicit ephemeral semantic activation identity;\n- activation excluded from provider child environments;\n- exact `workspace_write` path/content authorization;\n- fresh race-aware workspace observation;\n- exact final-byte verification;\n- reconcile provider ACK loss before returning;\n- no-op when exact requested bytes are already satisfied.\n\n### Slice 2\n\n- exact activation-bound `web_open` / `web_interact` authorization;\n- bind requests to fresh browser pre-state;\n- preserve current network/expected-effect constraints;\n- fresh reconciliation even when provider delivery acknowledgement is lost;\n- no blind retry.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\n\nNo CapabilityRegistry/EventBus, OPA/Cedar service, durable chat session/grant store, generic provider API, new public tool, automatic retry, or Rust Native Host implementation.\n\nRust Native Host v1 remains separately pinned in ROADMAP after CAP Core v1 freeze.\n\n## Sequencing\n\nStacked chain remains:\n\n`#159 -> #165 -> #166 -> #167 -> #168 -> #169`\n\nThis PR remains Draft and cannot merge ahead of prerequisites.\n\n## Slice 1 implementation status\n\nImplemented on branch after the research brief:\n\n- launcher-owned ephemeral semantic activation with inherited-value overwrite;\n- activation excluded from filesystem/Playwright provider environments;\n- Core-backed `semantic_workspace_write.py` capability gate;\n- exact activation/path/content authorization binding;\n- race-aware before/final file observation;\n- verified no-op when requested bytes are already present;\n- mandatory exact-byte verification after every attempted write;\n- acknowledgement-loss reconciliation with no blind retry;\n- installed-runtime/package manifests and adversarial acceptance coverage.\n\nLatest implementation commit: `96514a93725d577ebb5797239c050c3124c883af`.\n\n## External technical review finding closure — F3\n\nThe additional PR 151–169 technical review reported a P2 Unicode regression in the new browser authorizer: Python canonicalized resources with `ensure_ascii=True`, so permitted non-ASCII text expanded before the internal size bound.\n\n**Disposition: CONFIRMED and fixed.**\n\nRoot cause / failure class:\n\n```text\npublic UTF-8 / character-bounded input\n -> ASCII-escaped Python canonical JSON\n -> alphabet-dependent internal expansion\n -> valid Unicode request rejected before delivery\n```\n\nFix on exact head `c9fce847c0712ac913d6cb49787f892c11514fbb`:\n\n- semantic browser resource canonicalization now uses canonical UTF-8 JSON (`ensure_ascii=False`);\n- finite request/resource byte ceilings remain and are sized for the accepted public request envelope;\n- Python boundary tests cover large Cyrillic, non-BMP and escaped-control inputs;\n- a real Node -> Python bridge acceptance test exercises the same large inputs through `authorizeSemanticBrowserMutation()`.\n\nExact-head Semantic Projection Acceptance reports `SEMANTIC_BROWSER_AUTHORIZATION_UNICODE_BOUNDARY=PASS`; full `ci`, Stage 26.3A, Direct Tunnel, CodeQL, security and dependency-reproducibility checks also pass.\n\nThe reported F3 mechanism is closed. This material post-review fix requires a fresh mandatory ordinary-Chat exact-head semantic review before merge.","closed_at":null,"created_at":"2026-09-22T17:10:06Z","draft":true,"head":{"ref":"research/direct-semantic-mutation-gate","repo":"BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform","repo_id":1326588757,"repo_node_id":"R_kgDOTxIjVQ","sha":"c9fce847c0712ac913d6cb49787f892c11514fbb"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/pull/169","id":4604783772,"locked":false,"merge_commit_sha":null,"merged_at":null,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTxIjVc8AAAABEndsnA","number":169,"state":"open","title":"Core: authorize and verify direct semantic mutations","updated_at":"2026-09-22T20:33:41Z","user":{"id":225327645,"login":"BogdanAIP","type":"User"}},"repository":"BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform","repository_id":1326588757,"repository_node_id":"R_kgDOTxIjVQ","review_comments":[],"reviews":[],"schema_version":"github_pr_evidence_snapshot_v1","source":{"api_base":"https://api.github.com","pull_request_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/pull/169"}}
